	[ -5 5 ] ( offset | x offset + y 4 colour fill-disc ) each ;

\ the left of the panel, as the photographed Spitfire II's: along the top the navigation lights' switch, the flaps' lever and the accelerometer; under them the oxygen regulator's plate over its delivery and supply dials (the photograph's display stopwatch beside them, a Memorial Flight fitting, left out); then the clock, the undercarriage indicator's plate, the brakes' triple gauge and the elevator trim's gauge; the magneto switches at the foot, the board running to the screen's bottom. The navigation lights' switch is drawn and does nothing; the flaps' warning plate, worded as the photograph's with the type's flap limit, stands under the clock, there being no room for it beside the lever
: draw-left-panel ( -- )
	108 panel-top 60 + draw-toggle
