	61 panel-top 112 + "FLAPS MUST" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
	61 panel-top 118 + "NOT BE" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
	61 panel-top 124 + "LOWERED" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
	61 panel-top 130 + "ABOVE" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
