\ === beneath the panel ===

\ the throttle lever in its quadrant on the left wall, forward for open; beside it the mixture lever, forward for rich, and the propeller's pitch lever, forward for fine pitch or the most revolutions; the boost cut-out's red lever beyond them, lit when pushed forward; the quadrants from a row and of a height
: draw-throttle-lever-of ( top height -- )
	| top height |
	plane@propeller :constant-speed = if
		plane@revolution-setting lowest-revolutions - plane@type@rated-revolutions lowest-revolutions - /
	else
		plane@fine if 1 else 0 then
	then to pitch
	[ [ 8 plane@throttle 6 needle-colour ] [ 26 plane@mixture 5 brass-colour ] [ 44 pitch 5 dial-ink ] ] ( lever |
		lever spread to colour to radius to setting to x
		x top 12 height edge-colour outline
		x 6 + top 2 + x 6 + top height + 2 - edge-colour draw-segment
		x 6 + top height + 6 - setting height 10 - * - radius colour fill-disc
	) each
	62 top 4 plane@boost-cut-out if warning-colour else 0x502018 then fill-disc ;

\ the quadrants at the floor's level, 36 px tall
: draw-throttle-lever ( -- ) floor-top 4 + 36 draw-throttle-lever-of ;

\ the rudder pedals on the floor at two places across with their tops at a row, each a frame narrowing forward with two bars across it; the pedal on the rudder's side pushed forward and the other drawn back
: draw-frame-pedals-at ( left-x right-x row -- )
	| left-x right-x row |
	controls@yaw 8 * to push
	[ [ left-x push ] [ right-x push negate ] ] to pedals
	0 2 1 do k
		pedals k @i spread to offset to x
		row offset + to top
		top 28 + to bottom
		x 24 - top x 24 + top pedal-colour draw-segment
		x 24 + top x 30 + bottom pedal-colour draw-segment
		x 30 + bottom x 30 - bottom pedal-colour draw-segment
		x 30 - bottom x 24 - top pedal-colour draw-segment
		x 26 - top 9 + x 26 + top 9 + pedal-colour draw-segment
		x 28 - top 19 + x 28 + top 19 + pedal-colour draw-segment
	loop ;

\ the pedals at two places across on the floor below the panel
