\ the sight itself, in faint lines: the reflector glass, a plate standing over the panel's coaming with its upper corners cut, the reticle in the middle of it; the two posts holding it; the housing of the lamp and lens below it on the coaming
: draw-sight-outline ( cx cy -- )
	| cx cy |
	sight-frame-colour lighting dimmed to colour
	[ [ -66 -62 ] [ -54 -74 ] [ 54 -74 ] [ 66 -62 ] [ 66 58 ] [ -66 58 ] ] ( corner | [ cx corner first + cy corner second + ] ) map to glass
	0 glass size 1 do k
		glass k @i spread glass k 1+ glass size mod @i spread colour draw-clipped
	loop
	[ -1 1 ] ( side |
		cx side 60 * + cy 58 + cx side 30 * + view-height 1 - colour draw-clipped
	) each
	cx 30 - view-height 18 - cx 30 + view-height 18 - colour draw-clipped
	cx 30 - view-height 18 - cx 30 - view-height 1 - colour draw-clipped
	cx 30 + view-height 18 - cx 30 + view-height 1 - colour draw-clipped ;

\ the reflector sight in the windscreen, centred at a screen place on the guns' line: the sight's own faint outline; the ring with the centre spot; a cross whose four arms stand outside the ring, each as long as the ring's radius; and inside the ring the horizontal range bars, broken by a gap that the target's wingspan fills at the set range
: draw-sight ( cx cy -- )
	| cx cy |
	focal-length sight-ring-angle * round to radius
	focal-length sight-span 2 / * sight-range / round to gap
	cx cy draw-sight-outline
	cx cy radius sight-colour draw-circle
	cx cy 1 sight-colour fill-disc
	cx cy radius 2 * - cx cy radius - sight-line
	cx cy radius + cx cy radius 2 * + sight-line
	cx radius 2 * - cy cx radius - cy sight-line
	cx radius + cy cx radius 2 * + cy sight-line
	cx radius - cy cx gap - cy sight-line
	cx gap + cy cx radius + cy sight-line ;

\ a wall wheel's scale above it, the setting's mark between the two ends' letters, and its name under it
