	cx setting 14 * + round to mark
	mark cy 20 - mark cy 12 - needle-colour wall-colour translucent draw-segment
	cx 20 - cy 19 - low dial-ink wall-colour translucent centred-text
	cx 20 + cy 19 - high dial-ink wall-colour translucent centred-text
	cx cy 13 + name dial-ink wall-colour translucent centred-text ;

\ a trim wheel on the left wall, a ring with four spokes turned with its setting, from -1 to 1; above it its scale, the setting's mark between the two ends' letters; its name under it
: draw-wall-wheel ( cx cy setting low high name -- )
	| cx cy setting low high name |
