	loop
	cx cy setting low high name draw-wheel-scale ;

\ the Spitfire's and the Hurricane's panel top, arched as the photographed Spitfire panel's coaming is: a parabola 2 px below the view's top at the centre and 48 px lower at the view's sides, the plate's edge 4 px under it; the rows their front view is drawn in, so the scene runs on behind the arch to the foot of its corners
