	x0 y0 x1 row x0 row colour fill-face
	x0 y0 x1 y1 edge-colour draw-segment ;

\ the rudder trim's hand wheel on the left wall, as a photograph of the Spitfire's shows it, a wheel with a knurled rim and a red mark on it, seen edge-on from the seat: a tall rectangle, the rim's edge, with the knurls as bars across it that roll with the setting, and the red mark riding up the rim as the setting goes right; the rim black, its edges and knurls in the pedals' faint colour, as the controls at the edge of the view are drawn, being beside the pilot rather than before him
