	cx half-width - cy half-height - half-width 2 * half-height 2 * colour outline
	half-height 2 * to span
	0 span 6 / round 1 do k
		k 6 * setting 15 * - span mod span + span mod cy half-height - + round to y
		cx half-width - y cx half-width + y colour draw-segment
	loop
	cx half-width - cy setting half-height 0.8 * * - round 1- half-width 2 * 3 warning-colour wall-colour translucent fill-span ;

