\ the left board of the Hurricane's panel, after the labelled cockpit, top to bottom: the indicator lamps' two switches and the undercarriage indicator; the buzzer's warning plate and the lamps' plate; the oxygen regulator with its two dials; under it the emergency boost knob, the magneto switches and, at the board's right down to its foot, the clock; along the foot the two engine starting buttons and the three toggle switches under their plate, pressure head heat, navigation lights and cine camera (the magnetos sit above the toggles, not beside them as in the picture, the board being too narrow for the clock and all three at its foot). The lamp switches, the magnetos and the toggles are drawn and do nothing
