	116 panel-top 171 + "MAGNETO" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
	116 panel-top 195 + draw-magnetos
	164 panel-top 194 + draw-trip-clock
	78 panel-top 205 + "ENGINE" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
	78 panel-top 210 + "STARTING" 4 dial-ink centred-lettering
	78 panel-top 222 + draw-starter-buttons
