\ the rows the front view is drawn in for the type's panel: deeper for the Gladiator's sloped plate and the Spitfire's and Hurricane's arched ones, the view's own for the Lysander's flat panel
: cockpit-view-rows ( -- rows )
	plane@type@kind to kind
	kind :lysander = if panel-top exit then
	kind :gladiator = if gladiator-view-rows exit then
	arched-view-rows ;

\ the cockpit below the windscreen, the type's own
: draw-panel ( -- )
	plane@type@kind to kind
	kind :hurricane = if draw-hurricane-panel exit then
	kind :lysander = if draw-lysander-panel exit then
	kind :gladiator = if draw-gladiator-panel exit then
	draw-spitfire-panel ;
